<div class="Page__contentArea"><div>
<div id="c11f4df9"><section id="n-oslash-kkelinformasjon" class="tDwjVFExbPlqwnaU86Wz"><div class="Fov3KMlE7osNR74JI44t"><div class="Wf6h4ZdN2S9XvO6RoMCf"><h2 class="FrR9v_ssranAjR5kDzwF tNNRbfeiPsdi3j_gpC7k">N&oslash;kkelinformasjon</h2><ul class="dE8scaebAaiVDo4BSvWD jQbeCSjNzeFEwKyP9FS0"><li class="iIoZpbf7rJjFaPayfYGd"><div class="i9mvzE2ZVt1U_mgl53yZ NBkadhPtSiaEbuC1H71t"><div class="_HPUHJNlNHRSzaUJfTVb"><span class="SvgIcon tA8I0a90PWzmxCh2AhM3"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-check-circle"></use></svg></span><h3 class="ecyElYvuOSSL_6pZBv9V">Unikt studium</h3></div><div class="cZ1dIE6oJgjjufj0oSwG RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark">Dette er det eneste bachelorstudiet av sitt slag i Norge.</div></div></li><li class="iIoZpbf7rJjFaPayfYGd"><div class="i9mvzE2ZVt1U_mgl53yZ NBkadhPtSiaEbuC1H71t"><div class="_HPUHJNlNHRSzaUJfTVb"><span class="SvgIcon tA8I0a90PWzmxCh2AhM3"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-check-circle"></use></svg></span><h3 class="ecyElYvuOSSL_6pZBv9V">Utveksling</h3></div><div class="cZ1dIE6oJgjjufj0oSwG RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark">Oppdag verden mens du studerer! Se hvor du kan dra p&aring; utveksling nederst p&aring; siden.</div></div></li><li class="iIoZpbf7rJjFaPayfYGd"><div class="i9mvzE2ZVt1U_mgl53yZ NBkadhPtSiaEbuC1H71t"><div class="_HPUHJNlNHRSzaUJfTVb"><span class="SvgIcon tA8I0a90PWzmxCh2AhM3"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-check-circle"></use></svg></span><h3 class="ecyElYvuOSSL_6pZBv9V">Praktisk studium</h3></div><div class="cZ1dIE6oJgjjufj0oSwG RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark"><span>Bruk toppmoderne fasiliteter, bransjestandard programvare og virkelige prosjekter for &aring; bygge din egen profesjonelle showreel.</span></div></div></li><li class="iIoZpbf7rJjFaPayfYGd"><div class="i9mvzE2ZVt1U_mgl53yZ NBkadhPtSiaEbuC1H71t"><div class="_HPUHJNlNHRSzaUJfTVb"><span class="SvgIcon tA8I0a90PWzmxCh2AhM3"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-error-circle"></use></svg></span><h3 class="ecyElYvuOSSL_6pZBv9V">Viktige frister</h3></div><div class="cZ1dIE6oJgjjufj0oSwG RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark">S&oslash;knadsfristen er forlenget. Opptaket fortsetter s&aring; lenge det er ledige plasser.</div></div></li><li class="iIoZpbf7rJjFaPayfYGd"><div class="i9mvzE2ZVt1U_mgl53yZ NBkadhPtSiaEbuC1H71t"><div class="_HPUHJNlNHRSzaUJfTVb"><span class="SvgIcon tA8I0a90PWzmxCh2AhM3"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-user"></use></svg></span><h3 class="ecyElYvuOSSL_6pZBv9V">Opptakskrav</h3></div><div class="cZ1dIE6oJgjjufj0oSwG RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark">Du m&aring; innfri krav om <a href="/studere-hos-oss/opptaksinformasjon/">generell studiekompetanse eller tilsvarende</a>.</div></div></li><li class="iIoZpbf7rJjFaPayfYGd"><div class="i9mvzE2ZVt1U_mgl53yZ NBkadhPtSiaEbuC1H71t"><div class="_HPUHJNlNHRSzaUJfTVb"><span class="SvgIcon tA8I0a90PWzmxCh2AhM3"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-credit-card"></use></svg></span><h3 class="ecyElYvuOSSL_6pZBv9V">Pris</h3></div><div class="cZ1dIE6oJgjjufj0oSwG RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark">62 100 kr pr semester. Kvalifiserer til <a href="/studere-hos-oss/opptaksinformasjon/lanekassen/">st&oslash;tte fra L&aring;nekassen</a>.</div></div></li></ul><ul class="KdKtz5eB9ExUSDYJcdj8"><li><div class="QfpSu3R9osOn5mtmUmRN lgn5jtFtWmCfY3jJKvE1 _YiOaSqqzZqBucsGKGGx U9uDXh99G9DWi_Yh96aO EPjsXy4Ah89AtUfpopbN Iga6BKVCOIbIKJLg1wb5" title="Nivå"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-book"></use></svg></span><span class="usSRVYlqJnoDeG8iYItA">Bachelor</span></div></li><li><div class="QfpSu3R9osOn5mtmUmRN lgn5jtFtWmCfY3jJKvE1 _YiOaSqqzZqBucsGKGGx U9uDXh99G9DWi_Yh96aO EPjsXy4Ah89AtUfpopbN Iga6BKVCOIbIKJLg1wb5" title="Oppstart"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-clock"></use></svg></span><span class="usSRVYlqJnoDeG8iYItA">Høst 2026</span></div></li><li><div class="QfpSu3R9osOn5mtmUmRN lgn5jtFtWmCfY3jJKvE1 _YiOaSqqzZqBucsGKGGx U9uDXh99G9DWi_Yh96aO EPjsXy4Ah89AtUfpopbN Iga6BKVCOIbIKJLg1wb5" title="Gjennomføring"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-activity"></use></svg></span><span class="usSRVYlqJnoDeG8iYItA">Heltid</span></div></li><li><div class="QfpSu3R9osOn5mtmUmRN lgn5jtFtWmCfY3jJKvE1 _YiOaSqqzZqBucsGKGGx U9uDXh99G9DWi_Yh96aO EPjsXy4Ah89AtUfpopbN Iga6BKVCOIbIKJLg1wb5" title="Studiepoeng"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-award"></use></svg></span><span class="usSRVYlqJnoDeG8iYItA">180 studiepoeng</span></div></li><li><div class="QfpSu3R9osOn5mtmUmRN lgn5jtFtWmCfY3jJKvE1 _YiOaSqqzZqBucsGKGGx U9uDXh99G9DWi_Yh96aO EPjsXy4Ah89AtUfpopbN Iga6BKVCOIbIKJLg1wb5" title="Studiested"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-map-pin"></use></svg></span><span class="usSRVYlqJnoDeG8iYItA">Oslo</span></div></li><li><div class="QfpSu3R9osOn5mtmUmRN lgn5jtFtWmCfY3jJKvE1 _YiOaSqqzZqBucsGKGGx U9uDXh99G9DWi_Yh96aO EPjsXy4Ah89AtUfpopbN Iga6BKVCOIbIKJLg1wb5" title="Studielengde"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-calendar"></use></svg></span><span class="usSRVYlqJnoDeG8iYItA">3 år</span></div></li><li><div class="QfpSu3R9osOn5mtmUmRN lgn5jtFtWmCfY3jJKvE1 _YiOaSqqzZqBucsGKGGx U9uDXh99G9DWi_Yh96aO EPjsXy4Ah89AtUfpopbN Iga6BKVCOIbIKJLg1wb5" title="Språk"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-message-square"></use></svg></span><span class="usSRVYlqJnoDeG8iYItA">Engelsk</span></div></li></ul></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['c11f4df9-json'] = {"id":"n-oslash-kkelinformasjon","title":{"value":"N&oslash;kkelinformasjon"},"facts":[{"title":{"value":"Unikt studium"},"icon":"check-circle","content":{"value":"Dette er det eneste bachelorstudiet av sitt slag i Norge."}},{"title":{"value":"Utveksling"},"icon":"check-circle","content":{"value":"Oppdag verden mens du studerer! Se hvor du kan dra p&aring; utveksling nederst p&aring; siden."}},{"title":{"value":"Praktisk studium"},"icon":"check-circle","content":{"value":"<span>Bruk toppmoderne fasiliteter, bransjestandard programvare og virkelige prosjekter for &aring; bygge din egen profesjonelle showreel.</span>"}},{"title":{"value":"Viktige frister"},"icon":"error-circle","content":{"value":"S&oslash;knadsfristen er forlenget. Opptaket fortsetter s&aring; lenge det er ledige plasser."}},{"title":{"value":"Opptakskrav"},"icon":"user","content":{"value":"Du m&aring; innfri krav om <a href=\"/studere-hos-oss/opptaksinformasjon/\">generell studiekompetanse eller tilsvarende</a>."}},{"title":{"value":"Pris"},"icon":"credit-card","content":{"value":"62 100 kr pr semester. Kvalifiserer til <a href=\"/studere-hos-oss/opptaksinformasjon/lanekassen/\">st&oslash;tte fra L&aring;nekassen</a>."}}],"tags":[{"title":"Nivå","icon":"book","value":"Bachelor"},{"title":"Oppstart","icon":"clock","value":"Høst 2026"},{"title":"Gjennomføring","icon":"activity","value":"Heltid"},{"title":"Studiepoeng","icon":"award","value":"180 studiepoeng"},{"title":"Studiested","icon":"map-pin","value":"Oslo"},{"title":"Studielengde","icon":"calendar","value":"3 år"},{"title":"Språk","icon":"message-square","value":"Engelsk"}]};</script></div>
</div><div>
<div id="9cdc7fef"><section id="hva-l-aelig-rer-du" class="cwjtYbGmpj2Fc0XguMNM"><div class="Fov3KMlE7osNR74JI44t"><div class="Wf6h4ZdN2S9XvO6RoMCf"><h2 class="FrR9v_ssranAjR5kDzwF aZkJAbcjSQdYr77t8LV7">Hva l&aelig;rer du?</h2><div class="zOMHtRvuigbQpkhq8l0i"><div class="FHwe9agruJdTg4dYFHN9"><div class="FktOVJkMpTVphR1rGeNp RichtextContent RichtextContent--light"><ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li>Vil du lage innhold til dataspill, film, TV eller nettsider? Computer Arts er et stort fagfelt med mange muligheter for dem som kan lage minneverdig innhold til ulike typer medier.</li>
<li>Denne utdanningen er unik i Norge, og gir deg et solid, faglig fundament &ndash; b&aring;de teknisk og kunstnerisk.</li>
<li>Undervisningen foreg&aring;r p&aring; engelsk, slik at du kan jobbe over hele verden.</li>
<li>Etter f&oslash;rste semester velger du mellom &eacute;n av fire studieretninger:
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li>3D-grafikk</li>
<li>Animasjon</li>
<li>Visual Effects (VFX)</li>
<li>Spilldesign</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul></div><button title="Mer om undervisningen" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="overlay_795" aria-haspopup="dialog" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT f_wbJQigmJWOUtJRHvmX"><span class="visuallyHidden">Mer om undervisningen</span><span class="SvgIcon Kw06kOpEjKtbccDsYKVG"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-plus-circle"></use></svg></span></button><div style="display:none"><div class="QhFNlQLYGSl_aaOQtwwl" style="display:none" id="overlay_795" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="overlayLabel_796"><div class="lAKZZQugItoUqTlu8DRV"></div><div tabindex="-1"><div class="po18YUo5kkFOZqsiTnKR"><div class="eOdUoHIpgD7QwsaR1kGn"><button title="Lukk overlagg" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT sZg2Vy20YIsqTNv9TcIX"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-circle-close"></use></svg></span><span class="visuallyHidden">Lukk overlagg</span></button></div><div class="fyYha0cYX3WzsCpMkhUB"><span id="overlayLabel_796" class="visuallyHidden">Mer om undervisningen</span><h3 class="vGAYXQ8qVh3muyCADVi0">Mer om undervisningen</h3><div class="RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark">Med dette studieprogrammet vil du f&aring; en omfattende forst&aring;else av digital innholdsproduksjon innen 3D-grafikk, animasjon, visuelle effekter eller spilldesign. Du vil utvikle b&aring;de kreative og tekniske ferdigheter, mestre bransjestandard programvare og produksjonsteknikker samtidig som du l&aelig;rer &aring; skape engasjerende visuelle fortellinger.</p>
<p>Programmet legger vekt p&aring; praktisk erfaring, tverrfaglig samarbeid og virkelige anvendelser, noe som sikrer at du er godt rustet til &aring; designe, animere og produsere arbeid av profesjonell kvalitet. I tillegg vil du bygge en sterk portef&oslash;lje og utvikle essensielle ferdigheter innen teamarbeid, probleml&oslash;sning og prosjektledelse, som alle er kritiske for suksess i den hurtigg&aring;ende digitale kunstindustrien.</p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li aria-level="1">Her kan du teste dataspillene v&aring;re studenter har laget: <a href="https://hk-game-design.itch.io/"><span data-contrast="none"><span data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink">https://hk-game-design.itch.io/</span></span></a><strong></strong></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Vil du vite mer om hvordan vi har det? F&oslash;lg oss her:</strong></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><strong><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@computerarts_kristiania">TikTok</a></strong></li>
<li><strong><a href="https://www.instagram.com/computerarts_kristiania/">Instagram</a></strong></li>
</ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="qB4kMuPluv5Id4WqPmfn"></div><div class="uMSWbISaLHTvPMbXhnYp"><div class="VNQ7BkWJFagCE_bBjsxQ ZLbmeOzjwEPCnL8UV8zG R1wh_51Fi_Crd9RnsQsw"><span class="FxrXNHIEItswETCvk14E" style="display:block"><span class="EwPhzUN1NfTBa1XOsTE6 TVMntCe8qkWIdDcQxQb6"></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['9cdc7fef-json'] = {"id":"hva-l-aelig-rer-du","title":{"value":"Hva l&aelig;rer du?"},"content":{"value":"<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li>Vil du lage innhold til dataspill, film, TV eller nettsider? Computer Arts er et stort fagfelt med mange muligheter for dem som kan lage minneverdig innhold til ulike typer medier.</li>\n<li>Denne utdanningen er unik i Norge, og gir deg et solid, faglig fundament &ndash; b&aring;de teknisk og kunstnerisk.</li>\n<li>Undervisningen foreg&aring;r p&aring; engelsk, slik at du kan jobbe over hele verden.</li>\n<li>Etter f&oslash;rste semester velger du mellom &eacute;n av fire studieretninger:\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li>3D-grafikk</li>\n<li>Animasjon</li>\n<li>Visual Effects (VFX)</li>\n<li>Spilldesign</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>"},"overlayTitle":"Mer om undervisningen","overlayContent":{"value":"Med dette studieprogrammet vil du f&aring; en omfattende forst&aring;else av digital innholdsproduksjon innen 3D-grafikk, animasjon, visuelle effekter eller spilldesign. Du vil utvikle b&aring;de kreative og tekniske ferdigheter, mestre bransjestandard programvare og produksjonsteknikker samtidig som du l&aelig;rer &aring; skape engasjerende visuelle fortellinger.</p>\n<p>Programmet legger vekt p&aring; praktisk erfaring, tverrfaglig samarbeid og virkelige anvendelser, noe som sikrer at du er godt rustet til &aring; designe, animere og produsere arbeid av profesjonell kvalitet. I tillegg vil du bygge en sterk portef&oslash;lje og utvikle essensielle ferdigheter innen teamarbeid, probleml&oslash;sning og prosjektledelse, som alle er kritiske for suksess i den hurtigg&aring;ende digitale kunstindustrien.</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Her kan du teste dataspillene v&aring;re studenter har laget: <a href=\"https://hk-game-design.itch.io/\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">https://hk-game-design.itch.io/</span></span></a><strong></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Vil du vite mer om hvordan vi har det? F&oslash;lg oss her:</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@computerarts_kristiania\">TikTok</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/computerarts_kristiania/\">Instagram</a></strong></li>\n</ul>"},"gobiStoryId":"geo6r","imageFallback":null,"translations":{"openOverlay":"Mer om undervisningen","closeOverlay":"Lukk overlagg","openPlayer":"Åpne videospilleren","failedToLoadVideo":"Beklager, av en eller annen grunn kunne vi ikke laste inn en video"}};</script></div>
</div><div>
<div id="ccf4273c"><section id="studiemodell" class="eXDLkCBTey4RjrTQSVwU"><div class="coBlOy78vCNQoCaBJMWq"><div class="fIm4MtcrG6MCKKd8iidQ"><h2 class="FrR9v_ssranAjR5kDzwF A9Jn0XOSrtngUTCr8gcL">Studiemodell</h2><div class="t78ozlVAuwJUrQItlgiY"><span class="IKcqvZpEOT2PNX0vgEn0">Studiemodellen er et utdrag av programbeskrivelsen. Den gir deg en oversikt over obligatoriske emner og hvilke muligheter du har for praksis, utveksling og studieretninger. Bachelorgraden går over tre studieår. Hvert studieår er delt opp i to semestre. Vi tar forbehold om endringer.

For å se studiemodellen for de ulike studieretningene, kan du trykke på Studieretninger og velge den du vil se.</span></div></div></div><div class="DwbrqOYPLpXMxa_AUi5a"><div class="c4EHzShG0bxjcWsv1iba _jn80nJpcKPRabCSPcI8 o7i_4ji7xZ2pdim0DGGS r6PBO9Z23nGvfMtmlwMK dT6kOO1SWAAgm3_8NHMn"><div class="w6rdwzyeKdZC4QEQQdUG"><div class="FQnvPH3eSTnAU6bvrkhn"><div class="IbD8iYA8j6gRUkFt19Qt nUUm_USrpFGrNosOvcCN gXLqKND3fX0_VG9NQewb"><div role="tablist" class="_NQp5NLSF5eDFXAqjrMf" aria-label="Velg år"><button id="tab_1" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="tabPanel_1" type="button" class="wSwA7V6mKnVhr5xFafzq Sqayds_IfbVRGAlPcZz1"><span class="bAoReRDLMgoAniQxqdep">Første år</span></button><button id="tab_2" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="tabPanel_2" type="button" class="wSwA7V6mKnVhr5xFafzq"><span class="bAoReRDLMgoAniQxqdep">Andre år</span></button><button id="tab_3" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="tabPanel_3" type="button" class="wSwA7V6mKnVhr5xFafzq"><span class="bAoReRDLMgoAniQxqdep">Tredje år</span></button></div></div><span class="FaaFQQsQ1uH8384yNffh">Totalt 180 studiepoeng</span></div><div id="tabPanel_1" class="xD2nuHiyJc0KNBTM5TWg" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab_1"><div class="XtdQZg9bKtEzGXT39oxb"><div style="will-change:height;overflow:visible;height:auto" class="wpyTqNTlEGsGZ_xfFehk L7NlqGAknErj1_Ksfbxg"><div class="XjUXAnCLxrJU_S3Faibn km5O6Vr04dX9qXqlrGMV"><div id="comboSelect_id746" class="bbDHU4_JdA0hl9MD1Lrq">Studieretning:</div><div class="G7gxiY379IAtJbKPKotG W_Gk92VdcIWIfdXHtrIi JAYJggZS6dLysWsv5IiA KDyaKDlnhHkPeQ8TQpwW"><div class="oNgbub_RmiAb8AEl5vq8"><select id="select747" class="ej2uuZxjdlcJKkYzu50J" aria-describedby="comboSelect_id746"><option value="3D-graphics (3D-grafikk)" selected="">3D-graphics (3D-grafikk)</option><option value="Animation (animasjon)">Animation (animasjon)</option><option value="Game Design (spilldesign)">Game Design (spilldesign)</option><option value="Visual Effects">Visual Effects</option></select><span class="SvgIcon mgusG_yyQk0V0MGeK9Ur"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-triangle"></use></svg></span></div></div></div></div><div style="will-change:height;overflow:hidden;visibility:hidden;height:0" class="wpyTqNTlEGsGZ_xfFehk BK3qq6WSy_IM14HivUP2"><div class="XjUXAnCLxrJU_S3Faibn km5O6Vr04dX9qXqlrGMV Wc0G2UOdAM4L2tA07AtA"><div id="comboSelect_id748" class="bbDHU4_JdA0hl9MD1Lrq">Valgmuligheter:</div><fieldset aria-describedby="comboSelect_id748"><div class="drG0qWE9kXwq4x52jnrJ"><div class="Sp19XW4DI_sJH0_4zvTF"><div class="PHAoRS_eP5FouDCPNKdY GhAWyApR_JjGprSMJ2rM yje2hGysH1zQf_D0GsA7 echijgywrVRRk64pe6Cg"><input type="radio" id="FormComponents__radio__749" class="YfHgbQjwjs4O8VWhll1c" name="study-option-selector" checked="" value="Ordinært studieløp"/><label for="FormComponents__radio__749" class="XTEgAUAWtLfl5XRg_bT7"><span class="yUjgOv16CeoVvFj3U4nh">Ordinært studieløp</span></label></div><div class="PHAoRS_eP5FouDCPNKdY GhAWyApR_JjGprSMJ2rM yje2hGysH1zQf_D0GsA7 echijgywrVRRk64pe6Cg"><input type="radio" id="FormComponents__radio__750" class="YfHgbQjwjs4O8VWhll1c" name="study-option-selector" value="Ordinært studieløp"/><label for="FormComponents__radio__750" class="XTEgAUAWtLfl5XRg_bT7"><span class="yUjgOv16CeoVvFj3U4nh">Utveksling</span></label></div></div></div></fieldset></div></div><span class="NPFkgrIiXfIBoY50mCiN">60 studiepoeng</span><div class="osNFPrEfj_WDLlms79Vw"><div class="gIhCJK5vlYW4N6yeTlUe C70d_1unGsLcavciTBWP g8GJRoyN3YYrck7buLCF" style="grid-template-columns:auto repeat(4, minmax(min-content, 1fr))"><div class="PVTUTdX7fee_uJTuRkiD ihFnGka9xDug5NPWFh0C"></div><div class="PH6z9gi7b9kHBB9jOhSt nPbPqGrz5Ue0OKa68YnY z7vhCTYrC3rO2VoUPlYT">1. semester</div><div class="PH6z9gi7b9kHBB9jOhSt nPbPqGrz5Ue0OKa68YnY _MLObcIsnBTnfP4F5AQg">2. semester</div><div class="Ka1VIQ2BSAPjauIEHrxP" style="grid-column:2 / span 3;grid-row:1"><div role="none" class="jkzRoAa60jRsn7WFC38b W_ipeNxzDR7tVIgpSCZn" tabindex="-1"><h3 class="YG1nlAZdhHLMRy9GYzR4"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="overlay_751" aria-haspopup="dialog" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT H8BBXS4M_AkAanZLMEqS"><div class="Lv5sVd5u45Hei4dM91D6"><span class="cLkCE07zhLnMWRjri1dT">Introduction to Computer Arts</span><span class="scgJDiGbZP69e6JD2e1j">COA100</span></div></button></h3><div class="k1UzcGuDdqoVJEx_3umq"><div class="QfpSu3R9osOn5mtmUmRN AK7QRdIj4UViy_jglQrq jno52DfczcFYoXwAJOAu U9uDXh99G9DWi_Yh96aO EPjsXy4Ah89AtUfpopbN Iga6BKVCOIbIKJLg1wb5 RNsXkIAukZjr8f4x_HXA iFv6rrcS3ouLeLPVmLv7">22,5<!-- --> <!-- -->stp.</div></div></div><div style="display:none"><div class="QhFNlQLYGSl_aaOQtwwl" style="display:none" id="overlay_751" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="overlayLabel_752"><div class="lAKZZQugItoUqTlu8DRV"></div><div tabindex="-1"><div class="po18YUo5kkFOZqsiTnKR"><div class="eOdUoHIpgD7QwsaR1kGn"><button title="Lukk overlagg" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT sZg2Vy20YIsqTNv9TcIX"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-circle-close"></use></svg></span><span class="visuallyHidden">Lukk overlagg</span></button></div><div class="fyYha0cYX3WzsCpMkhUB"><span id="overlayLabel_752" class="visuallyHidden">Åpne emneoverlegg</span><div><h3 class="E3lyE2pUr4JODpEYbHMe">Introduction to Computer Arts</h3><div class="vyo8UTe2MiSR4m0iLBYR">
<p>The course is an introduction to the Bachelor in Computer Arts programme and gives the student a basic overview of the subject with a focus on the specialisations in the study programme. Emphasis is placed on the student getting an overview of the four areas of study in the programme so that they can make an informed choice after the first semester. The students will work on computer arts related projects to gain insights into the specialisations. They will therefore gain a basic understanding of concepts, methods and tools within all fields of study.</p><p>Furthermore, the student will get an introduction to concepts and topics that cut across all fields of study. The student will also get an overview of the industries in which they will typically be able to work after completing their degree.</p><p>The subject also shows how the student goes about making a showreel which is the basis for a job application in the industry, and the student also makes his/hers first version of this.</p>
</div><div class="iCNqjCRL4lMHUFqVaQaB"><button disabled="" type="button" class="yEK9biWpMxeKit4W3SEn HIBx2TMQpGodNFRbYUAk Pf5HgbFCxXwoDDfyfLsp cJMgeHEGyMPOPNoeRPfY I0dQ9KoNo8oj51pfedVE yWrwquZkc56N0bYjqb7s"><span>Les mer</span><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="Ka1VIQ2BSAPjauIEHrxP" style="grid-column:5 / span 1;grid-row:1"><div role="none" class="jkzRoAa60jRsn7WFC38b W_ipeNxzDR7tVIgpSCZn" tabindex="-1"><h3 class="YG1nlAZdhHLMRy9GYzR4"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="overlay_753" aria-haspopup="dialog" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT H8BBXS4M_AkAanZLMEqS"><div class="Lv5sVd5u45Hei4dM91D6"><span class="cLkCE07zhLnMWRjri1dT">IMPACT - Introduksjon til tverrfaglig samarbeid</span><span class="scgJDiGbZP69e6JD2e1j">FTV118</span></div></button></h3><div class="k1UzcGuDdqoVJEx_3umq"><div class="QfpSu3R9osOn5mtmUmRN AK7QRdIj4UViy_jglQrq jno52DfczcFYoXwAJOAu U9uDXh99G9DWi_Yh96aO EPjsXy4Ah89AtUfpopbN Iga6BKVCOIbIKJLg1wb5 RNsXkIAukZjr8f4x_HXA iFv6rrcS3ouLeLPVmLv7">7,5<!-- --> <!-- -->stp.</div></div></div><div style="display:none"><div class="QhFNlQLYGSl_aaOQtwwl" style="display:none" id="overlay_753" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="overlayLabel_754"><div class="lAKZZQugItoUqTlu8DRV"></div><div tabindex="-1"><div class="po18YUo5kkFOZqsiTnKR"><div class="eOdUoHIpgD7QwsaR1kGn"><button title="Lukk overlagg" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT sZg2Vy20YIsqTNv9TcIX"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-circle-close"></use></svg></span><span class="visuallyHidden">Lukk overlagg</span></button></div><div class="fyYha0cYX3WzsCpMkhUB"><span id="overlayLabel_754" class="visuallyHidden">Åpne emneoverlegg</span><div><h3 class="E3lyE2pUr4JODpEYbHMe">IMPACT - Introduksjon til tverrfaglig samarbeid</h3><div class="vyo8UTe2MiSR4m0iLBYR">
<p>Dette emnet gir en introduksjon til tverrfaglig samarbeid innen fagfeltene i film og medier, der utviklingsmetoder, selvstendig refleksjon og ansvar for egen læring står i sentrum. Emnet skal utforske den rollen tverrfaglig samarbeid kan ha i et samfunnsperspektiv. </p><p>Emnet har en undersøkende tilnærming til fagfeltene foto, klipp, lyddesign, manus, regi, produksjon, visual effects, spilldesign, 3D-grafikk og animasjon. Emnet tilbyr en introduksjon til vitenskapelige og kunstneriske metoder. Det skal også diskuteres etiske hensyn og perspektiver, med særlig vekt på inkludering, mangfold og bærekraft. </p><p>Det legges vekt på de felles faglige grunnelementer på tvers av fagene: idé- og konseptutvikling, planlegging og samarbeid i skapende prosesser. Studentene utvikler her begynnende forståelse for fagfeltenes roller. </p><p>Studentene skal jobbe sammen i tverrfaglige grupper, og vil få tilbakemelding på felles oppgaver løst i disse. Studentene skal introduseres for strukturert hverandrevurdering i kunstnerisk utvikling. </p>
</div><div class="iCNqjCRL4lMHUFqVaQaB"><button disabled="" type="button" class="yEK9biWpMxeKit4W3SEn HIBx2TMQpGodNFRbYUAk Pf5HgbFCxXwoDDfyfLsp cJMgeHEGyMPOPNoeRPfY I0dQ9KoNo8oj51pfedVE yWrwquZkc56N0bYjqb7s"><span>Les mer</span><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="Ka1VIQ2BSAPjauIEHrxP" style="grid-column:2 / span 1;grid-row:3"><div role="none" class="jkzRoAa60jRsn7WFC38b W_ipeNxzDR7tVIgpSCZn" tabindex="-1"><h3 class="YG1nlAZdhHLMRy9GYzR4"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="overlay_755" aria-haspopup="dialog" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT H8BBXS4M_AkAanZLMEqS"><div class="Lv5sVd5u45Hei4dM91D6"><span class="cLkCE07zhLnMWRjri1dT">3D-graphics 1</span><span class="scgJDiGbZP69e6JD2e1j">3DG121</span></div></button></h3><div class="k1UzcGuDdqoVJEx_3umq"><div class="QfpSu3R9osOn5mtmUmRN ftxYN6Cf0R37irTe8gq3 jno52DfczcFYoXwAJOAu U9uDXh99G9DWi_Yh96aO EPjsXy4Ah89AtUfpopbN Iga6BKVCOIbIKJLg1wb5 RNsXkIAukZjr8f4x_HXA">Studieretning</div><div class="QfpSu3R9osOn5mtmUmRN AK7QRdIj4UViy_jglQrq jno52DfczcFYoXwAJOAu U9uDXh99G9DWi_Yh96aO EPjsXy4Ah89AtUfpopbN Iga6BKVCOIbIKJLg1wb5 RNsXkIAukZjr8f4x_HXA iFv6rrcS3ouLeLPVmLv7">7,5<!-- --> <!-- -->stp.</div></div></div><div style="display:none"><div class="QhFNlQLYGSl_aaOQtwwl" style="display:none" id="overlay_755" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="overlayLabel_756"><div class="lAKZZQugItoUqTlu8DRV"></div><div tabindex="-1"><div class="po18YUo5kkFOZqsiTnKR"><div class="eOdUoHIpgD7QwsaR1kGn"><button title="Lukk overlagg" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT sZg2Vy20YIsqTNv9TcIX"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-circle-close"></use></svg></span><span class="visuallyHidden">Lukk overlagg</span></button></div><div class="fyYha0cYX3WzsCpMkhUB"><span id="overlayLabel_756" class="visuallyHidden">Åpne emneoverlegg</span><div><h3 class="E3lyE2pUr4JODpEYbHMe">3D-graphics 1</h3><div class="vyo8UTe2MiSR4m0iLBYR">
<p>Emnet <em>3D graphics 1</em> er et innledende emne i å jobbe med 3D-grafikk og legger grunnlaget for resten av studiet. Å jobbe med 3D-grafikk vil si å skape virtuelle objekter og scener for stillbilder, animasjon og spill/sanntidsapplkasjoner. Emnet gir studenten grunnleggende ferdigheter i modellering, materialer og teksturer, lyssetting av 3D-scener, og grunnleggende prinsipper rundt komposisjon og kamerateknikker for å skape og sette opp scener med 3D-grafikk.</p>
</div><div class="iCNqjCRL4lMHUFqVaQaB"><button disabled="" type="button" class="yEK9biWpMxeKit4W3SEn HIBx2TMQpGodNFRbYUAk Pf5HgbFCxXwoDDfyfLsp cJMgeHEGyMPOPNoeRPfY I0dQ9KoNo8oj51pfedVE yWrwquZkc56N0bYjqb7s"><span>Les mer</span><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="Ka1VIQ2BSAPjauIEHrxP" style="grid-column:3 / span 1;grid-row:3"><div role="none" class="jkzRoAa60jRsn7WFC38b W_ipeNxzDR7tVIgpSCZn" tabindex="-1"><h3 class="YG1nlAZdhHLMRy9GYzR4"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="overlay_757" aria-haspopup="dialog" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT H8BBXS4M_AkAanZLMEqS"><div class="Lv5sVd5u45Hei4dM91D6"><span class="cLkCE07zhLnMWRjri1dT">3D-graphics 2</span><span class="scgJDiGbZP69e6JD2e1j">3DG122</span></div></button></h3><div class="k1UzcGuDdqoVJEx_3umq"><div class="QfpSu3R9osOn5mtmUmRN ftxYN6Cf0R37irTe8gq3 jno52DfczcFYoXwAJOAu U9uDXh99G9DWi_Yh96aO EPjsXy4Ah89AtUfpopbN Iga6BKVCOIbIKJLg1wb5 RNsXkIAukZjr8f4x_HXA">Studieretning</div><div class="QfpSu3R9osOn5mtmUmRN AK7QRdIj4UViy_jglQrq jno52DfczcFYoXwAJOAu U9uDXh99G9DWi_Yh96aO EPjsXy4Ah89AtUfpopbN Iga6BKVCOIbIKJLg1wb5 RNsXkIAukZjr8f4x_HXA iFv6rrcS3ouLeLPVmLv7">7,5<!-- --> <!-- -->stp.</div></div></div><div style="display:none"><div class="QhFNlQLYGSl_aaOQtwwl" style="display:none" id="overlay_757" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="overlayLabel_758"><div class="lAKZZQugItoUqTlu8DRV"></div><div tabindex="-1"><div class="po18YUo5kkFOZqsiTnKR"><div class="eOdUoHIpgD7QwsaR1kGn"><button title="Lukk overlagg" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT sZg2Vy20YIsqTNv9TcIX"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-circle-close"></use></svg></span><span class="visuallyHidden">Lukk overlagg</span></button></div><div class="fyYha0cYX3WzsCpMkhUB"><span id="overlayLabel_758" class="visuallyHidden">Åpne emneoverlegg</span><div><h3 class="E3lyE2pUr4JODpEYbHMe">3D-graphics 2</h3><div class="vyo8UTe2MiSR4m0iLBYR">
<p>Emnet <em>3D graphics 2</em> er et videregående emne innen 3D-modellering og presentasjon av 3D-scener. Arbeidet innen dette emnet gir studenten dypere kunnskap og ferdigheter innen polygon-modellering, digital skuptering, teksturering og material-innstillinger for karakterer og scener. Emnet fokuserer også på hvordan studenten med lys, materialer og 'compositing' kan oppnå gode visuelle uttrykk i 3D-scener.</p>
</div><div class="iCNqjCRL4lMHUFqVaQaB"><button disabled="" type="button" class="yEK9biWpMxeKit4W3SEn HIBx2TMQpGodNFRbYUAk Pf5HgbFCxXwoDDfyfLsp cJMgeHEGyMPOPNoeRPfY I0dQ9KoNo8oj51pfedVE yWrwquZkc56N0bYjqb7s"><span>Les mer</span><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="Ka1VIQ2BSAPjauIEHrxP" style="grid-column:4 / span 2;grid-row:3"><div role="none" class="jkzRoAa60jRsn7WFC38b W_ipeNxzDR7tVIgpSCZn" tabindex="-1"><h3 class="YG1nlAZdhHLMRy9GYzR4"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="overlay_759" aria-haspopup="dialog" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT H8BBXS4M_AkAanZLMEqS"><div class="Lv5sVd5u45Hei4dM91D6"><span class="cLkCE07zhLnMWRjri1dT">Characters and Environments</span><span class="scgJDiGbZP69e6JD2e1j">3DG216</span></div></button></h3><div class="k1UzcGuDdqoVJEx_3umq"><div class="QfpSu3R9osOn5mtmUmRN ftxYN6Cf0R37irTe8gq3 jno52DfczcFYoXwAJOAu U9uDXh99G9DWi_Yh96aO EPjsXy4Ah89AtUfpopbN Iga6BKVCOIbIKJLg1wb5 RNsXkIAukZjr8f4x_HXA">Studieretning</div><div class="QfpSu3R9osOn5mtmUmRN AK7QRdIj4UViy_jglQrq jno52DfczcFYoXwAJOAu U9uDXh99G9DWi_Yh96aO EPjsXy4Ah89AtUfpopbN Iga6BKVCOIbIKJLg1wb5 RNsXkIAukZjr8f4x_HXA iFv6rrcS3ouLeLPVmLv7">15<!-- --> <!-- -->stp.</div></div></div><div style="display:none"><div class="QhFNlQLYGSl_aaOQtwwl" style="display:none" id="overlay_759" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="overlayLabel_760"><div class="lAKZZQugItoUqTlu8DRV"></div><div tabindex="-1"><div class="po18YUo5kkFOZqsiTnKR"><div class="eOdUoHIpgD7QwsaR1kGn"><button title="Lukk overlagg" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT sZg2Vy20YIsqTNv9TcIX"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-circle-close"></use></svg></span><span class="visuallyHidden">Lukk overlagg</span></button></div><div class="fyYha0cYX3WzsCpMkhUB"><span id="overlayLabel_760" class="visuallyHidden">Åpne emneoverlegg</span><div><h3 class="E3lyE2pUr4JODpEYbHMe">Characters and Environments</h3><div class="vyo8UTe2MiSR4m0iLBYR">
<p>The purpose of the course is to give students the knowledge and skills to be able to carry out advanced character and environment design with 3D graphics. The focus of the course is to create a thematic overall style with an emphasis on history and personality in an advanced scene with character and surroundings.</p>
</div><div class="iCNqjCRL4lMHUFqVaQaB"><button disabled="" type="button" class="yEK9biWpMxeKit4W3SEn HIBx2TMQpGodNFRbYUAk Pf5HgbFCxXwoDDfyfLsp cJMgeHEGyMPOPNoeRPfY I0dQ9KoNo8oj51pfedVE yWrwquZkc56N0bYjqb7s"><span>Les mer</span><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="hUrOK4f2t5d89i_al5eu _jBcyRZzOe6QMtbojFs5"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="_qtIUhem1sc1EKjP4UhQ"><div id="tabPanel_2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab_2"><ul><li><span>COA200</span><span>Computer Arts Production 1</span><div>
<p>The purpose of the course is to give the student a holistic experience with a larger computer arts production involving their specialization.</p><p>The student will plan and carry out a comprehensive production in a group, and will receive training in both interdisciplinary teamwork and the use of modern techniques, methods and tools used for the organization and production of a large scale project. The student will be able to understand the different phases of production and how each group member contributes, as well as the different team roles.</p>
</div></li><li><span>WFM200</span><span>Media Art Innovation Lab</span><div>
<p>Media Art Innovation Lab (MAIL) er et tverrfaglig fellesemne ved Westerdals Institutt for Film og Medier (WIFM). </p><p>Dette emnet fungerer som et laboratorium for innovasjon, fremmer nye tenkemåter og samarbeidsmetoder, og gir studentene muligheten til å utforske nyskapende, kreative og eksperimentelle tilnærminger innenfor medie- og kunstfeltet. </p><p>En sentral del av emnet er tverrfaglig samarbeid. Studenter fra flere studieprogram jobber sammen i grupper for å planlegge, utvikle og gjennomføre prosjektarbeid. Dette bidrar til å utvikle studentenes samarbeidskompetanse, og gir dem muligheten til å respondere på og kommentere samfunnsspørsmål og den tiden vi lever i.   </p><p>Studentene vil også bli introdusert for verdiperspektiver som bærekraftige vurderinger og prinsipper for grønn produksjon, samt prinsipper for mangfold og integrering. </p><p>I dette emnet er det studentene som driver innovasjon og kreative prosesser, og utvikler kunnskap og ny innsikt i en undervisningskontekst der de er aktive deltakere i læringsprosessen. </p>
</div></li><li><span>3DG114</span><span>Realtime 3D Graphics</span><div>
<p>The subject is about how to create good and aesthetic design and interactions in prototypes made with real-time 3D graphics. The students become familiar with the possibilities of the development environment and effective use of this. Students learn to use advanced materials and lighting in interactive scenes.</p>
</div></li><li><span>3DG215</span><span>Architectural Visualization Theory and Practice</span><div>
<p>In this course students will learn how to visualize architecture or constructions in the different phases of a project. They are introduced to tools that are used for architectural visualization, and techniques applied for this.</p>
</div></li><li><span>ANI200</span><span>Acting for Animators</span><div>
<p>The course explores how acting techniques can be used in animation. To create characters with emotions and empathy, students are introduced to various aspects of acting techniques, including facial expressions for scenes with dialogue and improvisation. Through practical exercises, students will develop a deeper understanding of how to create scenes with characters that think, breathe, feel, and act.</p><p>Students will also learn how to film themselves for reference and how to effectively use this material by analyzing and applying these insights to their animations.</p>
</div></li><li><span>ANI203</span><span>Animation 3</span><div>
<p>Animation 3 builds on the principles from Animation 1 and Animation 2. This course takes you deeper into the fascinating world of storytelling, acting techniques, and dramaturgy to create engaging scenes.</p><p>During Animation 3, you will not only learn advanced animation techniques, such as facial animation, but also how to bring characters to life and imbue them with empathy throughout their journey. From miming to lively scenes with dialogue, we explore how to convey conflict, emotions, and personality through animation.</p><p>We focus on detailing and polishing in the final phase of the animation process. Here, you will fine-tune asymmetry in posing, both in the body and face, as well as variations in curves, spacing, and all the small details that bring the character to life.</p><p>Students will gain extensive experience in giving and receiving constructive feedback on their work.</p>
</div></li><li><span>SPD116</span><span>Prototyping</span><div>
<p>This course covers the fundamentals of system, UX, and UI design. Students learn to create, implement, and evaluate scalable game systems and intuitive, player-focused interfaces through prototypes. Emphasizing the connection between systems and UX/UI, the course teaches how to build gameplay-enhancing, usable designs. Projects include requirements analysis, human-centered design principles, flowcharts, wireframes, and progress from early prototypes to refined designs and user testing.</p>
</div></li><li><span>SPD209</span><span>Narrative and Level Design</span><div>
<p>In this course, the student will get a basic introduction to narrative structures linked to level design and visual storytelling techniques in games. The student will explore how video games tell stories, and how well-known principles from game and level design can enhance the narrative through mechanics, theme and mood. Through the course, the student will be introduced to narrative and level design, and gain practical experience with the design, development and iteration of virtual areas.</p>
</div></li><li><span>VFX221</span><span>Cinematography</span><div>
<p>The course gives students an introduction to photographic technique with a focus on composition and exposure/lighting. Students will learn to see subjects through the camera lens. Students also learn film as visual storytelling and how to use image composition, lighting and camera movement to tell a story. By filming their own VFX sequences, the students will increase their understanding of film and VFX techniques.</p>
</div></li><li><span>VFX222</span><span>3D for VFX</span><div>
<p>In this course the students will get an introduction to 3D graphics used as a tool towards work with visual effects (VFX). The students will gain basic skills in lighting and rendering of digital 3D objects with a view to integration in a VFX work process.</p>
</div></li><li><span>UTV999BA30</span><span>Utveksling</span><div></div></li><li><span>VAL999-7ENG</span><span>Elective course</span><div>
<p lang="en-US" style="text-indent:0pt;margin-left:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-right:0pt;"><a href="https://www.kristiania.no/for-studenter/valgemner-og-praksis/" style="color:#0000EE;text-decoration:underline ;">See elective courses</a><span lang="en-GB">.</span></p>
</div></li></ul></div><div id="tabPanel_3" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab_3"><ul><li><span>COA300</span><span>Computer Arts Production 2</span><div>
<p>This course will provide students with relevant experience in executing a major practical project within their field of study, with high standards for quality and execution. The production could be a large-scale game, film/animation, VFX, or visualization project.</p>
</div></li><li><span>COA360</span><span>Bachelor Production</span><div>
<p>The student will gain professional experience by completing a project in a company, establishing their own business, or participating in a self-defined comprehensive research project. In a practical research project, the student will demonstrate broad knowledge of central topics and research methodology, and show skills in teamwork, project management methods, and relevant tools. The project should have a professional character and be of high quality.</p><p>The course also includes a practical introduction to prepare the student for the industry. The student will gain knowledge about industry-specific law, the industry’s institutions and working methods, as well as tools such as application writing and self-presentation.</p>
</div></li><li><span>3DG217</span><span>Realtime 3D Graphics 2</span><div></div></li><li><span>ANI304</span><span>Animation 4</span><div>
<p>The course is an advanced animation course focusing on dramaturgy and behaviour for humans, animals, and creatures. The student will have the opportunity to develop their own expression and style. High standards are set for quality and execution in the last animation polishing phase. </p>
</div></li><li><span>SPD324</span><span>System Design 2</span><div>
<p>This course aims to provide students with a deeper understanding of system design through the lens of game balancing. Students will be introduced to advanced system design, which will be explored in detail. The course will cover various game mechanics, focusing on how these can be utilized, combined, and balanced to create a meaningful experience for the player.</p>
</div></li><li><span>VFX220</span><span>Compositing 3</span><div>
<p>Compositing 3 builds on the Compositing 2 course. The focus is on more advanced projects and typical advanced compositing tasks the students will encounter in the industry as well as completion of shots. Students will get to know some of the latest techniques and be able to make the final touches needed to deliver professional shots.</p>
</div></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div class="lv4eNMiZgLixMXhAvacD"><a href="/studieportal/fakultet-for-samfunn-kunst-og-medier/bachelorniva/bca/bachelor-in-computer-arts/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm UssovIOXlEuxxbOHY4c4 AMdryBi_G8WFVbcuUzSv LVwfmt8Qy2xfZW7GrHx_ I0dQ9KoNo8oj51pfedVE cJMgeHEGyMPOPNoeRPfY SwVWunM8J0KL5d8Ov54G" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi">Se programbeskrivelse</div></a></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['ccf4273c-json'] = {"heading":{"value":"Studiemodell"},"getSubjectInfoUrl":"/api/study-pages/133638/subjects-info-url","overlayContentMessages":{"outdated":{"heading":"Med forbehold om endringer","message":null,"variant":"info"},"fallback":{"heading":"Emnebeskrivelse kommer snart","message":{"value":"<span>Ved Kristiania utvikler vi studiene v&aring;re i samarbeid med arbeidslivet. Derfor oppdaterer vi emnene jevnlig, slik at du f&aring;r kompetansen som arbeidsgiverne ser etter. Snart kan du lese alt om dette emnet her, inntil da finner du mer informasjon i studieprogrambeskrivelsen.</span>"},"variant":"info"}},"subjects":[{"code":"COA100","name":"Introduction to Computer Arts","description":"\n<p>The course is an introduction to the Bachelor in Computer Arts programme and gives the student a basic overview of the subject with a focus on the specialisations in the study programme. Emphasis is placed on the student getting an overview of the four areas of study in the programme so that they can make an informed choice after the first semester. The students will work on computer arts related projects to gain insights into the specialisations. They will therefore gain a basic understanding of concepts, methods and tools within all fields of study.</p><p>Furthermore, the student will get an introduction to concepts and topics that cut across all fields of study. The student will also get an overview of the industries in which they will typically be able to work after completing their degree.</p><p>The subject also shows how the student goes about making a showreel which is the basis for a job application in the industry, and the student also makes his/hers first version of this.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":false,"order":11,"points":22.5,"year":1,"semester":"first","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":null,"studyOption":null,"category":"obligatory"},{"code":"COA200","name":"Computer Arts Production 1","description":"\n<p>The purpose of the course is to give the student a holistic experience with a larger computer arts production involving their specialization.</p><p>The student will plan and carry out a comprehensive production in a group, and will receive training in both interdisciplinary teamwork and the use of modern techniques, methods and tools used for the organization and production of a large scale project. The student will be able to understand the different phases of production and how each group member contributes, as well as the different team roles.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":true,"order":32,"points":15,"year":2,"semester":"first","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":null,"studyOption":null,"category":"obligatory"},{"code":"COA300","name":"Computer Arts Production 2","description":"\n<p>This course will provide students with relevant experience in executing a major practical project within their field of study, with high standards for quality and execution. The production could be a large-scale game, film/animation, VFX, or visualization project.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":true,"order":50,"points":22.5,"year":3,"semester":"first","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":null,"studyOption":null,"category":"obligatory"},{"code":"COA360","name":"Bachelor Production","description":"\n<p>The student will gain professional experience by completing a project in a company, establishing their own business, or participating in a self-defined comprehensive research project. In a practical research project, the student will demonstrate broad knowledge of central topics and research methodology, and show skills in teamwork, project management methods, and relevant tools. The project should have a professional character and be of high quality.</p><p>The course also includes a practical introduction to prepare the student for the industry. The student will gain knowledge about industry-specific law, the industry’s institutions and working methods, as well as tools such as application writing and self-presentation.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":true,"order":60,"points":30,"year":3,"semester":"second","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":null,"studyOption":null,"category":"obligatory"},{"code":"FTV118","name":"IMPACT - Introduksjon til tverrfaglig samarbeid","description":"\n<p>Dette emnet gir en introduksjon til tverrfaglig samarbeid innen fagfeltene i film og medier, der utviklingsmetoder, selvstendig refleksjon og ansvar for egen læring står i sentrum. Emnet skal utforske den rollen tverrfaglig samarbeid kan ha i et samfunnsperspektiv. </p><p>Emnet har en undersøkende tilnærming til fagfeltene foto, klipp, lyddesign, manus, regi, produksjon, visual effects, spilldesign, 3D-grafikk og animasjon. Emnet tilbyr en introduksjon til vitenskapelige og kunstneriske metoder. Det skal også diskuteres etiske hensyn og perspektiver, med særlig vekt på inkludering, mangfold og bærekraft. </p><p>Det legges vekt på de felles faglige grunnelementer på tvers av fagene: idé- og konseptutvikling, planlegging og samarbeid i skapende prosesser. Studentene utvikler her begynnende forståelse for fagfeltenes roller. </p><p>Studentene skal jobbe sammen i tverrfaglige grupper, og vil få tilbakemelding på felles oppgaver løst i disse. Studentene skal introduseres for strukturert hverandrevurdering i kunstnerisk utvikling. </p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":false,"order":12,"points":7.5,"year":1,"semester":"first","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":null,"studyOption":null,"category":"obligatory"},{"code":"WFM200","name":"Media Art Innovation Lab","description":"\n<p>Media Art Innovation Lab (MAIL) er et tverrfaglig fellesemne ved Westerdals Institutt for Film og Medier (WIFM). </p><p>Dette emnet fungerer som et laboratorium for innovasjon, fremmer nye tenkemåter og samarbeidsmetoder, og gir studentene muligheten til å utforske nyskapende, kreative og eksperimentelle tilnærminger innenfor medie- og kunstfeltet. </p><p>En sentral del av emnet er tverrfaglig samarbeid. Studenter fra flere studieprogram jobber sammen i grupper for å planlegge, utvikle og gjennomføre prosjektarbeid. Dette bidrar til å utvikle studentenes samarbeidskompetanse, og gir dem muligheten til å respondere på og kommentere samfunnsspørsmål og den tiden vi lever i.   </p><p>Studentene vil også bli introdusert for verdiperspektiver som bærekraftige vurderinger og prinsipper for grønn produksjon, samt prinsipper for mangfold og integrering. </p><p>I dette emnet er det studentene som driver innovasjon og kreative prosesser, og utvikler kunnskap og ny innsikt i en undervisningskontekst der de er aktive deltakere i læringsprosessen. </p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":true,"order":41,"points":22.5,"year":2,"semester":"second","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":null,"studyOption":{"label":"Ordinært studieløp","isDefault":true},"category":"obligatory"},{"code":"3DG114","name":"Realtime 3D Graphics","description":"\n<p>The subject is about how to create good and aesthetic design and interactions in prototypes made with real-time 3D graphics. The students become familiar with the possibilities of the development environment and effective use of this. Students learn to use advanced materials and lighting in interactive scenes.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":true,"order":30,"points":7.5,"year":2,"semester":"first","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"3D-graphics (3D-grafikk)","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"3DG121","name":"3D-graphics 1","description":"\n<p>Emnet <em>3D graphics 1</em> er et innledende emne i å jobbe med 3D-grafikk og legger grunnlaget for resten av studiet. Å jobbe med 3D-grafikk vil si å skape virtuelle objekter og scener for stillbilder, animasjon og spill/sanntidsapplkasjoner. Emnet gir studenten grunnleggende ferdigheter i modellering, materialer og teksturer, lyssetting av 3D-scener, og grunnleggende prinsipper rundt komposisjon og kamerateknikker for å skape og sette opp scener med 3D-grafikk.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":false,"order":20,"points":7.5,"year":1,"semester":"second","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"3D-graphics (3D-grafikk)","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"3DG122","name":"3D-graphics 2","description":"\n<p>Emnet <em>3D graphics 2</em> er et videregående emne innen 3D-modellering og presentasjon av 3D-scener. Arbeidet innen dette emnet gir studenten dypere kunnskap og ferdigheter innen polygon-modellering, digital skuptering, teksturering og material-innstillinger for karakterer og scener. Emnet fokuserer også på hvordan studenten med lys, materialer og 'compositing' kan oppnå gode visuelle uttrykk i 3D-scener.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":false,"order":21,"points":7.5,"year":1,"semester":"second","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"3D-graphics (3D-grafikk)","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"3DG215","name":"Architectural Visualization Theory and Practice","description":"\n<p>In this course students will learn how to visualize architecture or constructions in the different phases of a project. They are introduced to tools that are used for architectural visualization, and techniques applied for this.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":true,"order":31,"points":7.5,"year":2,"semester":"first","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"3D-graphics (3D-grafikk)","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"3DG216","name":"Characters and Environments","description":"\n<p>The purpose of the course is to give students the knowledge and skills to be able to carry out advanced character and environment design with 3D graphics. The focus of the course is to create a thematic overall style with an emphasis on history and personality in an advanced scene with character and surroundings.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":false,"order":22,"points":15,"year":1,"semester":"second","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"3D-graphics (3D-grafikk)","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"3DG217","name":"Realtime 3D Graphics 2","description":null,"isDescriptionOutdated":null,"order":50,"points":7.5,"year":3,"semester":"first","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"3D-graphics (3D-grafikk)","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"ANI101","name":"Animation 1","description":"\n<p>The subject Animation 1 gives students an introduction to animation processes and principles. Through practical work, students will learn to apply these animation principles to create vivid and believable animations.</p><p>At the same time, the students will explore the history of animation and learn how to find, analyze and use reference material to animate characters. In addition, the students will be introduced to posing. They will learn how different postures and movements can convey emotions and personality through sculpting poses in 3D.</p><p>This subject provides a solid foundation for further studies and practical work in animation.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":false,"order":20,"points":7.5,"year":1,"semester":"second","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"Animation (animasjon)","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"ANI102","name":"Animation 2","description":"\n<p>Animation 2 builds on the principles from Animation 1 with a further focus on process, body mechanics, and posing. In this course, the student will develop a broad knowledge of animation principles and their application to character animations.</p><p>We explore reference sources by analyzing body mechanics, anatomy, and physics to understand how movement works and how this is transferred to a 3D character.</p><p>We will particularly focus on body mechanics through the various phases of the animation process, where students learn how animation is gradually shaped to create believable and engaging animations.</p><p>Students will also gain experience in giving and receiving constructive feedback.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":false,"order":22,"points":15,"year":1,"semester":"second","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"Animation (animasjon)","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"ANI200","name":"Acting for Animators","description":"\n<p>The course explores how acting techniques can be used in animation. To create characters with emotions and empathy, students are introduced to various aspects of acting techniques, including facial expressions for scenes with dialogue and improvisation. Through practical exercises, students will develop a deeper understanding of how to create scenes with characters that think, breathe, feel, and act.</p><p>Students will also learn how to film themselves for reference and how to effectively use this material by analyzing and applying these insights to their animations.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":true,"order":30,"points":7.5,"year":2,"semester":"first","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"Animation (animasjon)","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"ANI203","name":"Animation 3","description":"\n<p>Animation 3 builds on the principles from Animation 1 and Animation 2. This course takes you deeper into the fascinating world of storytelling, acting techniques, and dramaturgy to create engaging scenes.</p><p>During Animation 3, you will not only learn advanced animation techniques, such as facial animation, but also how to bring characters to life and imbue them with empathy throughout their journey. From miming to lively scenes with dialogue, we explore how to convey conflict, emotions, and personality through animation.</p><p>We focus on detailing and polishing in the final phase of the animation process. Here, you will fine-tune asymmetry in posing, both in the body and face, as well as variations in curves, spacing, and all the small details that bring the character to life.</p><p>Students will gain extensive experience in giving and receiving constructive feedback on their work.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":true,"order":31,"points":7.5,"year":2,"semester":"first","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"Animation (animasjon)","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"ANI304","name":"Animation 4","description":"\n<p>The course is an advanced animation course focusing on dramaturgy and behaviour for humans, animals, and creatures. The student will have the opportunity to develop their own expression and style. High standards are set for quality and execution in the last animation polishing phase. </p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":true,"order":50,"points":7.5,"year":3,"semester":"first","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"Animation (animasjon)","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"VFX117","name":"Shot Design","description":"\n<p>In this course, the student will learn to design and plan cinematographic film shots that tell a story in an effective and aesthetic way. Through the study of shots from famous films, the student will gain insight into how cinematographers and directors design different types of shots as a tool to create a visual narrative. The student will learn to break down scripts into effective images and to previsualize these images using storyboards and animated previzualisation.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":false,"order":21,"points":7.5,"year":1,"semester":"second","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"Animation (animasjon)","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"SPD116","name":"Prototyping","description":"\n<p>This course covers the fundamentals of system, UX, and UI design. Students learn to create, implement, and evaluate scalable game systems and intuitive, player-focused interfaces through prototypes. Emphasizing the connection between systems and UX/UI, the course teaches how to build gameplay-enhancing, usable designs. Projects include requirements analysis, human-centered design principles, flowcharts, wireframes, and progress from early prototypes to refined designs and user testing.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":true,"order":31,"points":7.5,"year":2,"semester":"first","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"Game Design (spilldesign)","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"SPD121","name":"Game Design 1","description":"\n<p>In this course, the students will be introduced to the theories and concepts that form the foundation of a modern understanding of games and game design. Students will study and analyze a wide range of games, learning to understand how game mechanics are used to create different types of gameplay experiences. Through this course, students will gain practical experience in the iterative development of game concepts, both individually and in groups.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":false,"order":20,"points":7.5,"year":1,"semester":"second","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"Game Design (spilldesign)","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"SPD122","name":"Game Design 2","description":"\n<p>Within the course, students will develop, in group, a 2D game from initial idea to completion and release. This course will give the students an introduction to 2D artistic tools and concepts, project management insights as well as teach them how to write the fundamental documents that a game designer needs to produce during a game development cycle. Students will also learn about the work processes, tools, and roles necessary to develop a 2D game and will deliver - in addition of their game - pitch decks, Game Design documents and art bible.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":false,"order":22,"points":15,"year":1,"semester":"second","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"Game Design (spilldesign)","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"SPD123","name":"System Design 1","description":"\n<p>The work in this course will familiarize students with the fundamental processes of analyzing, developing, and implementing system-based game design. The course will provide students with knowledge of a range of advanced topics in system design, including balancing, game AI, emergence, and progression. The course will also cover a selection of systems across various game types.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":false,"order":21,"points":7.5,"year":1,"semester":"second","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"Game Design (spilldesign)","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"SPD209","name":"Narrative and Level Design","description":"\n<p>In this course, the student will get a basic introduction to narrative structures linked to level design and visual storytelling techniques in games. The student will explore how video games tell stories, and how well-known principles from game and level design can enhance the narrative through mechanics, theme and mood. Through the course, the student will be introduced to narrative and level design, and gain practical experience with the design, development and iteration of virtual areas.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":true,"order":30,"points":7.5,"year":2,"semester":"first","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"Game Design (spilldesign)","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"SPD324","name":"System Design 2","description":"\n<p>This course aims to provide students with a deeper understanding of system design through the lens of game balancing. Students will be introduced to advanced system design, which will be explored in detail. The course will cover various game mechanics, focusing on how these can be utilized, combined, and balanced to create a meaningful experience for the player.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":true,"order":50,"points":7.5,"year":3,"semester":"first","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"Game Design (spilldesign)","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"VFX116","name":"Compositing 1","description":"\n<p>The subject is the student's first encounter with the specialization visual effects (VFX) in the BA in Computer Arts and gives students a basic understanding of what VFX is and how it is used in filmmaking. The student will get the first introduction to compositing. Through lectures and exercises, the student will learn to observe the world through the camera lens and will be introduced to VFX software, methods, pipeline and processes. Emphasis is placed on independent work and exercises that enable the student to produce simple VFX clips.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":false,"order":20,"points":7.5,"year":1,"semester":"second","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"Visual Effects","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"VFX117","name":"Shot Design","description":"\n<p>In this course, the student will learn to design and plan cinematographic film shots that tell a story in an effective and aesthetic way. Through the study of shots from famous films, the student will gain insight into how cinematographers and directors design different types of shots as a tool to create a visual narrative. The student will learn to break down scripts into effective images and to previsualize these images using storyboards and animated previzualisation.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":false,"order":21,"points":7.5,"year":1,"semester":"second","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"Visual Effects","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"VFX118","name":"Compositing 2","description":"\n<p>This subject will give the student a solid introduction to VFX software. The student will get a systematic review of the software interface and the nodes that were introduced in earlier courses. Through work on the subject, the student will further develop their understanding of colorspaces, rotoscoping, paint/cleanup, color correction and keying. Furthermore, the student will gain knowledge about the integration of rendered CG elements as well as more complex nodes, LUT's, expressions and Gizmos, and Nuke's 3D system especially for 2.5D compositing.</p><p>Throughout the course, the student will work in a VFX pipeline (work process) and receive weekly feedback in the dailies.</p><p>By solving production-related tasks, the student gets a solid foundation to build on and becomes comfortable with basic VFX tasks.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":false,"order":22,"points":15,"year":1,"semester":"second","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"Visual Effects","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"VFX220","name":"Compositing 3","description":"\n<p>Compositing 3 builds on the Compositing 2 course. The focus is on more advanced projects and typical advanced compositing tasks the students will encounter in the industry as well as completion of shots. Students will get to know some of the latest techniques and be able to make the final touches needed to deliver professional shots.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":true,"order":50,"points":7.5,"year":3,"semester":"first","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"Visual Effects","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"VFX221","name":"Cinematography","description":"\n<p>The course gives students an introduction to photographic technique with a focus on composition and exposure/lighting. Students will learn to see subjects through the camera lens. Students also learn film as visual storytelling and how to use image composition, lighting and camera movement to tell a story. By filming their own VFX sequences, the students will increase their understanding of film and VFX techniques.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":true,"order":30,"points":7.5,"year":2,"semester":"first","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"Visual Effects","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"VFX222","name":"3D for VFX","description":"\n<p>In this course the students will get an introduction to 3D graphics used as a tool towards work with visual effects (VFX). The students will gain basic skills in lighting and rendering of digital 3D objects with a view to integration in a VFX work process.</p>\n","isDescriptionOutdated":true,"order":31,"points":7.5,"year":2,"semester":"first","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":"Visual Effects","studyOption":null,"category":"specialization"},{"code":"UTV999BA30","name":"Utveksling","description":null,"isDescriptionOutdated":null,"order":1,"points":30,"year":2,"semester":"second","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":null,"studyOption":{"label":"Utveksling","isDefault":false},"category":"obligatory"},{"code":"VAL999-7ENG","name":"Elective course","description":"\r\n<p lang=\"en-US\" style=\"text-indent:0pt;margin-left:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-right:0pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.kristiania.no/for-studenter/valgemner-og-praksis/\" style=\"color:#0000EE;text-decoration:underline ;\">See elective courses</a><span lang=\"en-GB\">.</span></p>\r\n","isDescriptionOutdated":true,"order":31,"points":7.5,"year":2,"semester":"second","isPrerequisite":false,"specialization":null,"studyOption":{"label":"Ordinært studieløp","isDefault":true},"category":"elective"}],"translations":{"studyOptions":"Valgmuligheter","elective":"Valgemne","specialization":"Studieretning","selectYear":"Velg år","openSubjectOverlay":"Åpne emneoverlegg","closeOverlay":"Lukk overlagg","genericErrorMessage":"Feil oppsto","totalStudyPointsFormat":"Totalt {points} studiepoeng","studyPointsFormat":"{points} studiepoeng","pointsUnit":"stp.","noSubjectsMessage":"Beklager, det er problemer med å laste inn innholdet for øyeblikket","prerequisites":"Forkunnskaper","goToSubject":"Les mer","loading":"Laster inn data","year":"år","semester":"semester","single":"ett","first":"første","second":"andre","third":"tredje","fourth":"fjerde","fifth":"femte"},"type":"view","id":"studiemodell","teaser":"Studiemodellen er et utdrag av programbeskrivelsen. Den gir deg en oversikt over obligatoriske emner og hvilke muligheter du har for praksis, utveksling og studieretninger. Bachelorgraden går over tre studieår. Hvert studieår er delt opp i to semestre. Vi tar forbehold om endringer.\n\nFor å se studiemodellen for de ulike studieretningene, kan du trykke på Studieretninger og velge den du vil se.","settings":{"disableStudyModel":false,"disabledStudyModelHeading":"Informasjon om studiemodeller","disabledStudyModelMessage":{"value":"Studiemodellen er under arbeid og vil bli publisert så snart den er klar"}},"studyProgramLink":{"label":"Se programbeskrivelse","href":"/studieportal/fakultet-for-samfunn-kunst-og-medier/bachelorniva/bca/bachelor-in-computer-arts/","external":false,"showIsExternal":true}};</script></div>
</div><div>
<div id="be8e3f5d"><section id="hva-kan-du-bli" class="cr4GKFNCqp2Yu1c2kbOA cqvKGYSQUOkDhbqS2bc7"><div class="Fov3KMlE7osNR74JI44t"><div class="Wf6h4ZdN2S9XvO6RoMCf"><h2 class="FrR9v_ssranAjR5kDzwF vw2qEzBLsG8dfPFKhCCL">Hva kan du bli?</h2><div class="eCTirCs_JIAXtZrCECpB"><div class="s4PUgF87xJpwYCH4qegZ"><div class="gOFfCOGgsoYfQDsrulwN Um_bsxrmr048dYBfonAO hfMRvjcJ6bvRCr56YbNA"><div class="KgSPjnWKLeiPJ0FM0dQy RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark">Nyutdannede fra Kristianias Bachelor i Computer Arts er rustet for ulike karrieremuligheter innen animasjon, spilldesign, 3D-grafikk og visuelle effekter, med roller innen film, TV, spill, reklame og mer. Tidligere Kristiania-studenter jobber i dag i selskaper som:</div><div><ul class="qkBUwgQDLi4p_RY0dWv6"><li><a href="https://www.funcom.com/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi Ij1dPkiPlaTD3uo6se1x edl31Fo4Oj6a7JbI7uJy IUuKHagAD1zfQdGeQEQh GMFlTxWOaPaSRlpWaL1Q" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi LAgZMr1fyvbOVgj7_PsL"><span class="MUBYvmBUPBzTdaNqh8X9">Funcom</span><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right"></use></svg></span></div></a></li><li><a href="https://www.hypergames.no/nb/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi Ij1dPkiPlaTD3uo6se1x edl31Fo4Oj6a7JbI7uJy IUuKHagAD1zfQdGeQEQh GMFlTxWOaPaSRlpWaL1Q" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi LAgZMr1fyvbOVgj7_PsL"><span class="MUBYvmBUPBzTdaNqh8X9">Hyper Games</span><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right"></use></svg></span></div></a></li><li><a href="https://attensi.com/no/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi Ij1dPkiPlaTD3uo6se1x edl31Fo4Oj6a7JbI7uJy IUuKHagAD1zfQdGeQEQh GMFlTxWOaPaSRlpWaL1Q" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi LAgZMr1fyvbOVgj7_PsL"><span class="MUBYvmBUPBzTdaNqh8X9">Attensi</span><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right"></use></svg></span></div></a></li><li><a href="https://www.stormstudios.no/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi Ij1dPkiPlaTD3uo6se1x edl31Fo4Oj6a7JbI7uJy IUuKHagAD1zfQdGeQEQh GMFlTxWOaPaSRlpWaL1Q" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi LAgZMr1fyvbOVgj7_PsL"><span class="MUBYvmBUPBzTdaNqh8X9">Storm Studios</span><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right"></use></svg></span></div></a></li><li><a href="https://plyo.com/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi Ij1dPkiPlaTD3uo6se1x edl31Fo4Oj6a7JbI7uJy IUuKHagAD1zfQdGeQEQh GMFlTxWOaPaSRlpWaL1Q" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi LAgZMr1fyvbOVgj7_PsL"><span class="MUBYvmBUPBzTdaNqh8X9">Plyo</span><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right"></use></svg></span></div></a></li><li><a href="https://www.ilm.com/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi Ij1dPkiPlaTD3uo6se1x edl31Fo4Oj6a7JbI7uJy IUuKHagAD1zfQdGeQEQh GMFlTxWOaPaSRlpWaL1Q" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi LAgZMr1fyvbOVgj7_PsL"><span class="MUBYvmBUPBzTdaNqh8X9">Industrial Light &amp; Magic</span><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right"></use></svg></span></div></a></li><li><a href="https://gimpville.no/index.html" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi Ij1dPkiPlaTD3uo6se1x edl31Fo4Oj6a7JbI7uJy IUuKHagAD1zfQdGeQEQh GMFlTxWOaPaSRlpWaL1Q" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi LAgZMr1fyvbOVgj7_PsL"><span class="MUBYvmBUPBzTdaNqh8X9">Gimpville</span><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right"></use></svg></span></div></a></li></ul><button title="Flere karrieremuligheter" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="overlay_797" aria-haspopup="dialog" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT RLuLMRDzYQ3XgZOh0LH6"><span class="visuallyHidden">Flere karrieremuligheter</span><span class="SvgIcon qRe66TfUwTfvEUQmJRJf"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-plus-circle"></use></svg></span></button><div style="display:none"><div class="QhFNlQLYGSl_aaOQtwwl" style="display:none" id="overlay_797" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="overlayLabel_798"><div class="lAKZZQugItoUqTlu8DRV"></div><div tabindex="-1"><div class="po18YUo5kkFOZqsiTnKR"><div class="eOdUoHIpgD7QwsaR1kGn"><button title="Lukk overlagg" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT sZg2Vy20YIsqTNv9TcIX"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-circle-close"></use></svg></span><span class="visuallyHidden">Lukk overlagg</span></button></div><div class="fyYha0cYX3WzsCpMkhUB"><span id="overlayLabel_798" class="visuallyHidden">Flere karrieremuligheter</span><h3 class="QyHwrlI4c0dLFrsS3esJ">Flere karrieremuligheter</h3><div class="RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark">Du kan for eksempel jobbe som:</p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li>VFX-artist</li>
<li>Spilldesiner</li>
<li>Mediedesigner</li>
<li>VR-designer/utvikler</li>
</ul>
<p>Tidligere studenter er sv&aelig;rt ettertraktet i Computer Arts-industrien p&aring; grunn av den praktiske l&aelig;ringsprosessen de f&aring;r ved Kristiania. I tillegg er noen av fagene utviklet av og undervist av ledende kunstnere innen sine felt. Dette skaper imponerende jobbmuligheter for v&aring;re alumner.</p>
<p>Visste du for eksempel at flere Hollywood-blockbusterfilmer og TV-serier har hatt sine visuelle effekter laget i Norge? Scener fra "The Last of Us", "Black Panther - Wakanda Forever" og mange andre visuelle effekter du kanskje har sett, ble laget av noen av v&aring;re tidligere studenter.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="vtkkbZPYpUDSiSOigevy"><div role="none" class="lWrPSruci5J1Pct9eV_o g60OJyzhnb0WaPJax3FT q5hkvvHSqXSnC8c0ON1s" tabindex="-1"><div class="MgyILGUp5ZXfXioJozjl"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL vPKYJ9xnnqorRitmkm3i Rk4XtUg82KBc97x_ZRFE bdvXUDwmjTRBe1N3RN_T"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 1136px, (min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw" srcSet="/contentassets/fc0e9aaef22d499e83e6b27f9ec42718/ingvild-rein--storm-studios-hero-kristiania.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/fc0e9aaef22d499e83e6b27f9ec42718/ingvild-rein--storm-studios-hero-kristiania.jpg?width=768 768w, /contentassets/fc0e9aaef22d499e83e6b27f9ec42718/ingvild-rein--storm-studios-hero-kristiania.jpg?width=1136 1136w"/><img src="/contentassets/fc0e9aaef22d499e83e6b27f9ec42718/ingvild-rein--storm-studios-hero-kristiania.jpg?width=1136" alt="Foto av Ingvild som står på et fortau." style="object-position:33% 33%" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></div><div class="yMY00st3GGEGBJtEvQ73"><h3 class="c_Td561uP1rvuAN4AIF0"><a href="/aktuelt/2024/06/ingvild-kunne-ikke-noe-om-vfx--na-jobber-hun-pa-de-store-marvel-filmene/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><div>Slik fikk Ingvild jobben med &aring; lage effekter for &laquo;The Last of Us&raquo; og Marvels &laquo;Black Panther&raquo;</div></div></a></h3><div class="jEZzvXBk9gXoSYGacZ1a"><div class="upokinR30SLCCFTdntv0">– Jeg får være med på å lage min egen underholdning.</div><span class="SvgIcon PVmLk9OPaS3teC0Olseh"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-s"></use></svg></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['be8e3f5d-json'] = {"id":"hva-kan-du-bli","heading":{"value":"Hva kan du bli?"},"teaser":{"value":"Nyutdannede fra Kristianias Bachelor i Computer Arts er rustet for ulike karrieremuligheter innen animasjon, spilldesign, 3D-grafikk og visuelle effekter, med roller innen film, TV, spill, reklame og mer. Tidligere Kristiania-studenter jobber i dag i selskaper som:"},"linkList":[{"label":"Funcom","href":"https://www.funcom.com/","external":true,"showIsExternal":true},{"label":"Hyper Games","href":"https://www.hypergames.no/nb/","external":true,"showIsExternal":true},{"label":"Attensi","href":"https://attensi.com/no/","external":true,"showIsExternal":true},{"label":"Storm Studios","href":"https://www.stormstudios.no/","external":true,"showIsExternal":true},{"label":"Plyo","href":"https://plyo.com/","external":true,"showIsExternal":true},{"label":"Industrial Light & Magic","href":"https://www.ilm.com/","external":true,"showIsExternal":true},{"label":"Gimpville","href":"https://gimpville.no/index.html","external":true,"showIsExternal":true}],"featuredArticle":{"title":{"value":"Slik fikk Ingvild jobben med &aring; lage effekter for &laquo;The Last of Us&raquo; og Marvels &laquo;Black Panther&raquo;"},"description":{"value":"– Jeg får være med på å lage min egen underholdning."},"url":"/aktuelt/2024/06/ingvild-kunne-ikke-noe-om-vfx--na-jobber-hun-pa-de-store-marvel-filmene/","image":{"author":"Kristiania/Michael Reed Werenskjold","caption":"Ingvild Rein fikk jobb som Junior Compositor i anerkjente Storm Studios. – Det er en veldig spennende hverdag, og jeg får alltid være med på å lage ting som interesserer meg, forteller hun.","url":"/contentassets/fc0e9aaef22d499e83e6b27f9ec42718/ingvild-rein--storm-studios-hero-kristiania.jpg","alt":"Foto av Ingvild som står på et fortau.","focalPoint":{"x":0.33,"y":0.33},"lazyLoading":true}},"blockVariant":"default","overlayButtonLabel":"Flere karrieremuligheter","overlayHeading":"Flere karrieremuligheter","overlayContent":{"value":"Du kan for eksempel jobbe som:</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li>VFX-artist</li>\n<li>Spilldesiner</li>\n<li>Mediedesigner</li>\n<li>VR-designer/utvikler</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Tidligere studenter er sv&aelig;rt ettertraktet i Computer Arts-industrien p&aring; grunn av den praktiske l&aelig;ringsprosessen de f&aring;r ved Kristiania. I tillegg er noen av fagene utviklet av og undervist av ledende kunstnere innen sine felt. Dette skaper imponerende jobbmuligheter for v&aring;re alumner.</p>\n<p>Visste du for eksempel at flere Hollywood-blockbusterfilmer og TV-serier har hatt sine visuelle effekter laget i Norge? Scener fra \"The Last of Us\", \"Black Panther - Wakanda Forever\" og mange andre visuelle effekter du kanskje har sett, ble laget av noen av v&aring;re tidligere studenter."},"overlayCloseLabel":"Lukk overlagg"};</script></div>
</div><div>
<div id="93649ca1"><section id="m-oslash-t-fagmilj-oslash-et" class="xfIZ8IPRSKGxzL5KIyLz ZG9x_vn8GvsrSWPis7bl"><div class="Fov3KMlE7osNR74JI44t"><div class="Wf6h4ZdN2S9XvO6RoMCf"><h2 class="FrR9v_ssranAjR5kDzwF Bje8lNYEARjKXkaadcjl">M&oslash;t fagmilj&oslash;et</h2><div class="IP4WLEZAtSgblGP4Felg"><div class="KCVvuotjBI0iy0ATTKfK"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL vPKYJ9xnnqorRitmkm3i ssmQS4h9jzEH4V0L4NSN"><picture><source sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (min-width: 768px) 552px" srcSet="/contentassets/1c9858c948994fa0ba53a410bd673be9/spilldesign_3d_datalab-10.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/1c9858c948994fa0ba53a410bd673be9/spilldesign_3d_datalab-10.jpg?width=552 552w, /contentassets/1c9858c948994fa0ba53a410bd673be9/spilldesign_3d_datalab-10.jpg?width=768 768w, /contentassets/1c9858c948994fa0ba53a410bd673be9/spilldesign_3d_datalab-10.jpg?width=1536 1536w"/><img src="/contentassets/1c9858c948994fa0ba53a410bd673be9/spilldesign_3d_datalab-10.jpg?width=552" alt="Oversiktsbilde fra klasserom." style="object-position:34% 40%" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></div><ul class="tZx0pZhK8q3JNoQI8LCj"><li class="i8yQuD9MeLJCD5eDKft2"><div class="cVALO6yJDjmV1Xvkvynu"><div class="WWUAFGePNJBA0_seRWlX"><h3 class="TCpxq20heJlGBaSbNI4y">Disse m&oslash;ter du</h3><div class="AXbF9ehRSXzzERBwn1XK RichtextContent RichtextContent--light">Du vil blant annet m&oslash;te:</p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li>F&oslash;rstelektor<span>&nbsp;</span><strong><a href="/om-kristiania/ansatte/fakultet-for-samfunn-kunst-og-medier/institutt-for-scenekunst-film-og-medier/trygve-bjellvag/">Trygve Bjellv&aring;g</a></strong><span>&nbsp;</span>har jobbet hos FunCom, og undervist spilldesign i mer enn 10 &aring;r.</li>
<li>F&oslash;rsteamanuensis <a href="/om-kristiania/ansatte/fakultet-for-samfunn-kunst-og-medier/institutt-for-scenekunst-film-og-medier/ivar-kjellmo/"><strong>Ivar Kjellmo</strong></a> er billedkunstner med lang industrierfaring, og er en av forfatterne bak Norges f&oslash;rste l&aelig;rebok i 3D-grafikk.</li>
<li>F&oslash;rsteamanuensis <a href="/om-kristiania/ansatte/fakultet-for-samfunn-kunst-og-medier/institutt-for-scenekunst-film-og-medier/morten-moen/"><span><strong>Morten Moen</strong></span></a><span> er tidligere VFX Supervisor p&aring; Storm Studios. Han har v&aelig;rt med &aring; bygge opp VFX-bransjen i Norge og har jobbet p&aring; over 60 filmer og tv-serier.</span></li>
<li>F&oslash;rsteamanuensis <a href="/om-kristiania/ansatte/fakultet-for-samfunn-kunst-og-medier/institutt-for-scenekunst-film-og-medier/hans-gunnar-brekke/"><span><strong>Hans Gunnar Brekke</strong></span></a><span><span>&nbsp;</span>har mange &aring;rs erfaring fra store, utenlandske produksjoner som Jungelboken, Twilight og Hobbiten-filmene. Dette er brukt i utviklingen av studiet.</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span>Vi er en del av&nbsp;</span><a href="/fakulteter/fakultet-for-samfunn-kunst-og-medier/institutt-for-scenekunst-film-og-medier/">Institutt for scenekunst, film og medier</a><span>&nbsp;ved Kristiania.</span></div></div></div></li><li class="i8yQuD9MeLJCD5eDKft2"><div class="cVALO6yJDjmV1Xvkvynu"><div class="WWUAFGePNJBA0_seRWlX"><h3 class="TCpxq20heJlGBaSbNI4y">Slik jobber vi</h3><div class="AXbF9ehRSXzzERBwn1XK RichtextContent RichtextContent--light"><ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><span>Vi har et n&aelig;rt forhold til studentene v&aring;re og studentene til hverandre. Vi setter humor, lek og eksperimentering h&oslash;yt, og utfordrer studentene til &aring; utforske nye m&aring;ter &aring; v&aelig;re kreative p&aring;. Vi tror p&aring; det &aring; jobbe praktisk, og gjerne tverrfaglig.</span></li>
<li><span>I undervisningen og i arbeid med oppgaver p&aring; egenh&aring;nd bruker du de mest utbredte verkt&oslash;yene og programmene i bransjen. Du f&aring;r oppl&aelig;ring fra dyktige forelesere og gjesteforelesere.</span></li>
<li><span>Du f&aring;r tilbakemeldinger p&aring; dine prosjekter fra folk som jobber med noen av de st&oslash;rste merkevarene i bransjen, som Disney, Ringenes Herre og PlayStation.</span></li>
<li><span><a href="https://www.therookies.co/schools/kristiania-university-college">V&aring;r tidligere Bachelor i Visual Effects (n&aring; en studieretning i dette studiet) er sertifisert av bransjeorganisasjonen The Rookies som en av de beste VFX-utdanningene i verden</a>.</span></li>
</ul></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['93649ca1-json'] = {"id":"m-oslash-t-fagmilj-oslash-et","heading":{"value":"M&oslash;t fagmilj&oslash;et"},"testimonies":[{"heading":{"value":"Disse m&oslash;ter du"},"content":{"value":"Du vil blant annet m&oslash;te:</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li>F&oslash;rstelektor<span>&nbsp;</span><strong><a href=\"/om-kristiania/ansatte/fakultet-for-samfunn-kunst-og-medier/institutt-for-scenekunst-film-og-medier/trygve-bjellvag/\">Trygve Bjellv&aring;g</a></strong><span>&nbsp;</span>har jobbet hos FunCom, og undervist spilldesign i mer enn 10 &aring;r.</li>\n<li>F&oslash;rsteamanuensis <a href=\"/om-kristiania/ansatte/fakultet-for-samfunn-kunst-og-medier/institutt-for-scenekunst-film-og-medier/ivar-kjellmo/\"><strong>Ivar Kjellmo</strong></a> er billedkunstner med lang industrierfaring, og er en av forfatterne bak Norges f&oslash;rste l&aelig;rebok i 3D-grafikk.</li>\n<li>F&oslash;rsteamanuensis <a href=\"/om-kristiania/ansatte/fakultet-for-samfunn-kunst-og-medier/institutt-for-scenekunst-film-og-medier/morten-moen/\"><span><strong>Morten Moen</strong></span></a><span> er tidligere VFX Supervisor p&aring; Storm Studios. Han har v&aelig;rt med &aring; bygge opp VFX-bransjen i Norge og har jobbet p&aring; over 60 filmer og tv-serier.</span></li>\n<li>F&oslash;rsteamanuensis <a href=\"/om-kristiania/ansatte/fakultet-for-samfunn-kunst-og-medier/institutt-for-scenekunst-film-og-medier/hans-gunnar-brekke/\"><span><strong>Hans Gunnar Brekke</strong></span></a><span><span>&nbsp;</span>har mange &aring;rs erfaring fra store, utenlandske produksjoner som Jungelboken, Twilight og Hobbiten-filmene. Dette er brukt i utviklingen av studiet.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>Vi er en del av&nbsp;</span><a href=\"/fakulteter/fakultet-for-samfunn-kunst-og-medier/institutt-for-scenekunst-film-og-medier/\">Institutt for scenekunst, film og medier</a><span>&nbsp;ved Kristiania.</span>"}},{"heading":{"value":"Slik jobber vi"},"content":{"value":"<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><span>Vi har et n&aelig;rt forhold til studentene v&aring;re og studentene til hverandre. Vi setter humor, lek og eksperimentering h&oslash;yt, og utfordrer studentene til &aring; utforske nye m&aring;ter &aring; v&aelig;re kreative p&aring;. Vi tror p&aring; det &aring; jobbe praktisk, og gjerne tverrfaglig.</span></li>\n<li><span>I undervisningen og i arbeid med oppgaver p&aring; egenh&aring;nd bruker du de mest utbredte verkt&oslash;yene og programmene i bransjen. Du f&aring;r oppl&aelig;ring fra dyktige forelesere og gjesteforelesere.</span></li>\n<li><span>Du f&aring;r tilbakemeldinger p&aring; dine prosjekter fra folk som jobber med noen av de st&oslash;rste merkevarene i bransjen, som Disney, Ringenes Herre og PlayStation.</span></li>\n<li><span><a href=\"https://www.therookies.co/schools/kristiania-university-college\">V&aring;r tidligere Bachelor i Visual Effects (n&aring; en studieretning i dette studiet) er sertifisert av bransjeorganisasjonen The Rookies som en av de beste VFX-utdanningene i verden</a>.</span></li>\n</ul>"}}],"gobiStoryId":null,"imageFallback":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/1c9858c948994fa0ba53a410bd673be9/spilldesign_3d_datalab-10.jpg","alt":"Oversiktsbilde fra klasserom.","focalPoint":{"x":0.34,"y":0.4},"lazyLoading":true},"translations":{"openPlayer":"Åpne videospilleren","failedToLoadVideo":"Beklager, av en eller annen grunn kunne vi ikke laste inn en video"},"variant":"dark"};</script></div>
</div><div>
