</div><div>
<div id="8a717ddd"><section id="ofte-stilte-sp-oslash-rsm-aring-l" class="B_EDxoOxVgAU8kPXBQWa"><h2 class="FrR9v_ssranAjR5kDzwF Lz7bstkpq5d6FanMqkLu">Ofte stilte sp&oslash;rsm&aring;l</h2><div class="XmC_S2INgPyqbncnXLoy XL4KGq1qGQz8WwtKJ_pg"><div class="YKYBQ3jDmxdtO9SEemuL"><div class="uJgrlGAPM7ozrDvgjXt0"><ul class="csX3C9e9jiZog4fiK1f5"><li><div class="zsrYitxhmI4Rdxl8AcId te60PfIJAvlwZ2RBbGqe o80VkuFKdpLspcd2K6XW"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="AccordionItem__811" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT GNG_gRf6Dl3NsaHoWAUO OyyOerhMVj5mV5WQNX5V xZxJs8W876NY1tCMuMwq UM1jfJqOS1COdaoBDFKC"><div class="YSRmfctHOQ5noBfQfMH5"><div class="DnD1xRazitrvmLCwsQvo"><h3 class="Y1lcLNcJwl0MgDDEuPIe">Hva slags utstyr trenger jeg?</h3></div><span class="SvgIcon MFUfNtxb_KMTBmiHESl8"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-plus"></use></svg></span></div></button><div style="will-change:height;overflow:hidden;visibility:hidden;height:0" class="ZgXVgEgkOVHpOr6mpnZu"><div id="AccordionItem__811" class="pxYchGNIM3U95N_8sY2T"><div class="BcPDQdbKyOolxjjq14w1"><div class="RichtextContent">Dette f&aring;r du vite n&aring;r du begynner p&aring; studiet. Vi anbefaler deg &aring; vente med &aring; skaffe utstyr til da.</div></div></div></div></div></li><li><div class="zsrYitxhmI4Rdxl8AcId te60PfIJAvlwZ2RBbGqe o80VkuFKdpLspcd2K6XW"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="AccordionItem__812" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT GNG_gRf6Dl3NsaHoWAUO OyyOerhMVj5mV5WQNX5V xZxJs8W876NY1tCMuMwq UM1jfJqOS1COdaoBDFKC"><div class="YSRmfctHOQ5noBfQfMH5"><div class="DnD1xRazitrvmLCwsQvo"><h3 class="Y1lcLNcJwl0MgDDEuPIe">Kan jeg dra på utveksling?</h3></div><span class="SvgIcon MFUfNtxb_KMTBmiHESl8"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-plus"></use></svg></span></div></button><div style="will-change:height;overflow:hidden;visibility:hidden;height:0" class="ZgXVgEgkOVHpOr6mpnZu"><div id="AccordionItem__812" class="pxYchGNIM3U95N_8sY2T"><div class="BcPDQdbKyOolxjjq14w1"><div class="RichtextContent">Mer info kommer.</div></div></div></div></div></li><li><div class="zsrYitxhmI4Rdxl8AcId te60PfIJAvlwZ2RBbGqe o80VkuFKdpLspcd2K6XW"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="AccordionItem__813" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT GNG_gRf6Dl3NsaHoWAUO OyyOerhMVj5mV5WQNX5V xZxJs8W876NY1tCMuMwq UM1jfJqOS1COdaoBDFKC"><div class="YSRmfctHOQ5noBfQfMH5"><div class="DnD1xRazitrvmLCwsQvo"><h3 class="Y1lcLNcJwl0MgDDEuPIe">Kan jeg søke om praksis?</h3></div><span class="SvgIcon MFUfNtxb_KMTBmiHESl8"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-plus"></use></svg></span></div></button><div style="will-change:height;overflow:hidden;visibility:hidden;height:0" class="ZgXVgEgkOVHpOr6mpnZu"><div id="AccordionItem__813" class="pxYchGNIM3U95N_8sY2T"><div class="BcPDQdbKyOolxjjq14w1"><div class="RichtextContent"><span data-contrast="auto"><span>P&aring; dette studiet vil du ha mulighet til &aring; gj&oslash;re hele bacheloroppgaven din ute i bedrift. </span></span><span>&nbsp;<br /></span><span>&nbsp;<br /></span><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Kristiania har lang tradisjon med &aring; sende stud</span><span>enter ut i praksis. </span><span>&Aring; tilbringe en del av studieperioden </span><span>din </span><span>hos en</span><span> bedrift vil kunne gi deg relevant arbeid</span><span>serfaring, nye kontakter i bransjen, og </span><span>fungere som en spennende start p&aring; din nye karriere.</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span> </span></span></div></div></div></div></div></li><li><div class="zsrYitxhmI4Rdxl8AcId te60PfIJAvlwZ2RBbGqe o80VkuFKdpLspcd2K6XW"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="AccordionItem__814" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT GNG_gRf6Dl3NsaHoWAUO OyyOerhMVj5mV5WQNX5V xZxJs8W876NY1tCMuMwq UM1jfJqOS1COdaoBDFKC"><div class="YSRmfctHOQ5noBfQfMH5"><div class="DnD1xRazitrvmLCwsQvo"><h3 class="Y1lcLNcJwl0MgDDEuPIe">Hva kan jeg studere videre?</h3></div><span class="SvgIco